    "introduction": "BAE Systems develops and supports defence, aerospace and security equipment for government customers and their partners. Its activities include combat aircraft, naval ships and submarines, armoured vehicles, electronic systems, munitions and cyber capabilities. Revenue is largely generated through programmes that can run for many years, combining development, production and ongoing support. This creates substantial engineering and manufacturing requirements and close relationships with national defence authorities. Orders depend on government priorities and procurement budgets, while delivery depends on specialist staff and complex supply chains. Contract structures, project execution and the cost of meeting technical requirements are important to the profitability of individual programmes.",
